### 正常执行
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/saga-faults/SUCCESS

### 正向业务异常，触发补偿
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/saga-faults/FORWARD_EXCEPTION

### 模拟读取超时异常（并非真实网络延迟）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/saga-faults/READ_TIMEOUT

### 模拟连接失败异常（并非真实网络连接）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/saga-faults/CONNECT_FAILURE

### 正向失败后，已执行节点的补偿也抛异常
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/saga-faults/COMPENSATION_EXCEPTION
